          deckDescription: 'A standard 52-card French deck with one card removed (often 8 of diamonds); no jokers. Pope Joan is a round game: layout (Pope, Matrimony, Intrigue, etc.), then tricks; the turn-up may be a stop; scoring from layout and tricks.',
          suitDescription: 'The four French suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades); one card is usually removed to form a stop. The turn-up card sets trump; layout positions (e.g. Pope = King of diamonds) pay; suit matters for stops and tricks.',
